Place your local FreeSurfer license file here (as licenses/fs_license.txt) if you
want `run_pipeline.py --run-fmriprep` and scripts/fetch_fmriprep*.sh to discover
it automatically.

fMRIPrep refuses to run without a valid license, also with --fs-no-reconall
(scripts/fetch_fmriprep.sh --skip-reconall). Get one for free at
https://surfer.nmr.mgh.harvard.edu/registration.html

This file must not be committed (licenses/fs_license.txt is git- and
docker-ignored).

Lookup order used by the helper scripts:
1. --fs-license /absolute/path/to/license.txt
2. FS_LICENSE=/absolute/path/to/license.txt
3. licenses/fs_license.txt

The file may have any name; the scripts mount the file itself into the
container.
